1
00:00:00,468 --> 00:00:03,008
-Oh, we really need a strike here.
-I know.

2
00:00:03,221 --> 00:00:06,261
(Leonard:)-Take your time and concentrate.
-Leonard, stop pressuring me.

3
00:00:06,432 --> 00:00:08,722
(Leonard:)-I'm not pressuring you.
-You are. Just back off.

4
00:00:09,686 --> 00:00:11,516
(Leonard:)Okay. I'm sorry. I'll shut up.

5
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,270
(Penny:)I didn't mean shut up.

6
00:00:15,608 --> 00:00:16,778
(Leonard:)Fine.

7
00:00:16,943 --> 00:00:19,233
(Leonard:)Just tell me what to do and I'll do it.

8
00:00:20,488 --> 00:00:21,528
[SIGHS]

9
00:00:21,698 --> 00:00:24,738
(Penny:)No. This isn't fair to you, Leonard.
I'm sorry.

10
00:00:26,452 --> 00:00:28,872
Wait, where are you going?
Penny, come back.

11
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,250
(Sheldon:)I'll get you ice cream.

12
00:00:30,957 --> 00:00:33,957
(Leonard:)-No, let her go.
-Are you insane?

13
00:00:34,127 --> 00:00:35,957
(Sheldon:)If she leaves, it's over.

14
00:00:36,546 --> 00:00:39,216
(Leonard:)Pretty sure it's already over.

15
00:00:40,258 --> 00:00:41,838
WIL:
Tough luck, Sheldon.

16
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,890
(Sheldon:)You did this, didn't you?

17
00:00:46,097 --> 00:00:49,387
Do you think I would break up a couple
just to win a bowling match?

18
00:00:50,476 --> 00:00:53,726
(Sheldon:)-No, I suppose not.
-Good. Keep thinking that.

19
00:00:57,650 --> 00:01:00,940
(Stuart:)Wheaton....

20
00:01:04,324 --> 00:01:05,994
Mm-hm. Mm-hm. Yep.

21
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:10,619
(Stuart:)I'm telling you, the Match.com chicks
are much looser than on eHarmony.

22
00:01:12,624 --> 00:01:18,044
Oh. You know, I gotta call you back.
I won a bet and it's time to collect.

23
00:01:31,976 --> 00:01:35,816
(Raj:)I don't know about you,
but I feel empowered.

